<title>USA: Osicom wins contract from Unisys.</title>
<headline>Osicom wins contract from Unisys.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osicom Technologies Inc said Wednesday it had won a contract to supply Unisys Corp with its complete line of fiber distributed data interface (FDDI) cards.</p>
<p>The cards will be used in networking products being made by Unisys for the National Aeronautics and Space Administration.</p>
<p>Osicom estimates that sales of its networking products under this contract could reach $5 million. It is an indefinite-delivery, indefinite-quantity pact covering one year with three one-year options.</p>
<p>Osicom shares were up 1-1/4 at 10-7/8 at mid-afternoon.</p>
</text>
